<title>USA: 7th Level names Schupack chairman.</title>
<headline>7th Level names Schupack chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>7th Level Inc said Donald Schupak, CEO of Schupak Group and a 7th Level board member, was named chairman.</p>
<p>Bob Ezrin, 7th Level's co-founder and president, will assume the duties of chief executive officer on an interim basis, and he will create an office of the president comprised of key line executives.</p>
<p>The board accepted the resignations of George Grayson, chairman, co-founder and CEO and David Henkel, chief operating officer.</p>
</text>
